WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:02,660
in your imagination

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:05,100
What is a higher education institution like?

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,460
It's a higher level school

4
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:09,980
Will teach you some more advanced knowledge of guardianship

5
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,580
to some extent

6
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,980
Everything you said is correct

7
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:15,430
But this is just an ideal

8
00:00:15,430 --> 00:00:17,630
Institutions of higher learning like Qinyuan

9
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:21,030
The number of disappointed students every year is more than double

10
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,430
Disappointed quota

11
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:25,110
Institutions of higher learning are places where knowledge is taught

12
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:28,310
But it also fosters temporary integration in rural areas.

13
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:30,430
This world is not safe

14
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:33,870
There are many factors that should not be feared when applying courses in schools.

15
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:36,100
Naturally there will be indicators of disappointment

16
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,060
It’s a good thing that you are willing to work hard

17
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:41,940
But you must not act blindly. Mao Ran’s thoughts must be remembered.

18
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:44,380
Leave some green hills behind so you don’t have to worry about not picking them up and burning them

19
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:47,340
Expansion is the most important thing, I understand.

20
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:48,340
Thank you principal
